Z||000008||Viper'sVenom||09-18-2001||04:59 PM||||Thanks for all the quick replies.  I was only curious to see if it could be done, I thought there would be a problem with the belts but I just wanted to see if I would get lucky and have someone say "sure I have done that before".  As for the tranny I have a friend who works for Honda and I am going to see if he can locate an NSX tranny for me.  I have heard that it would work in the fiero.  I don't know if this would change anything but I really don't care about having a trunk, so cutting it away wouldn't bother me any, but I don't know if that would solve any problems.  I am probably about 2 years away from actually converting my fiero to a V8 and so I am just looking at the different possibilities.  Thank you everyone who has responded.||||reg||7
