Z||000012||Devotshka||09-18-2001||09:51 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Sootah:<BR><B>I'd like to see somebody stuff a V10 or 12 in there. </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>About a year or so ago one of the kitcar magazines had a 20-page or so list of various kits available for several platforms, one of which was called "Diablo AF" or "Diablo ATF" or similar for the Fiero.  The kit was actually an F50 kit, but it incorporated a logitudinal mount BMW V12.  Haven't heard a word about it since.  <P>Then again wedging a 12 or a 10 in an unmodified body would be a different story altogether... not to mention quite an accomplishment.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P><BR>||||reg||1
